    "intuition": "Changed paradigm_family from 'pairwise_margin' to 'pairwise_diff' to satisfy the required paradigm shift. The loss now computes a clamped difference of log probabilities weighted by advantage gap emphasizing preference direction but avoids the hinge constraint. Aggregation remains mean, and constraint changed to stable clamp to ensure numerical stability.",
